  "content": "\n\n<p>本模组为《我的世界》添加了金土豆<br><br>只需找到土豆&amp;金粒，即可合成为你自己的金土豆。你还可以合成金烤土豆<br><em><strong><br>金土豆</strong><strong>合成配方</strong></em><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1174/797/310/172/goldenpotatocraftingrecipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"170\"><br><em>1个土豆 + 8个金粒 = 1个金土豆<br><br><strong>金烤土豆</strong><strong>合成配方</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1174/798/310/172/goldenbakedpotatocraftingrecipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"172\"><br>1个烤土豆 + 8个金粒 = 1个金烤土豆<br><br><strong>金烤土豆</strong><strong>冶炼配方</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1174/801/310/172/goldenpotatofurnacesmeltingrecipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"224\" height=\"172\"><br><br><strong>金烤土豆&nbsp;高炉冶炼配方</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1174/803/310/172/goldenpotatoblastfurnacesmeltingrecipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"229\" height=\"172\"><br><br><strong>金烤土豆</strong><strong>烟熏配方</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1174/805/310/172/goldenpotatosmokersmokingrecipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"221\" height=\"172\"></em><br><br><em><strong>金烤土豆</strong><strong>篝火烹饪配方</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1174/806/310/172/goldenbakedpotatoscookingoncampfire.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"261\" height=\"172\"></em><br><br><em><strong>Zaynen的金土豆模组 | 模组展示<br>（敬请期待）<br></strong></em><em>保持搞怪！！！</em></p>",
